From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicola Ferralis <ferralis@generalflash.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:39:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ext: training stacks carry up to three mirrored bolt holes in
 the flange rim

As on the S 80 casing's ports: hole, mirror, hole, mirror. A 0016 model trained on one hole per
flange added a second mirror after the suction port's first pair (step 177) and never recovered.
Training goals only; every suite keeps its goals.
---
 freecad_s1/ext/mixed.py     | 48 +++++++++++++++++++++----------
 freecad_s1/ext/sampler.py   |  2 +-
 tests/test_ext_rim_holes.py | 56 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 91 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/test_ext_rim_holes.py

diff --git a/freecad_s1/ext/mixed.py b/freecad_s1/ext/mixed.py
